---
description: Require the Erinç co-author trailer on commits made for GitHub user theerinc
alwaysApply: true
---

When an agent works for Erinç (GitHub `theerinc`), every commit message must end with a blank line and exactly:

```
Co-authored-by: theerinc <erincyilmazz@gmail.com>
```

When squash-merging such pull requests, keep that trailer in the final commit message.
